  "caveats": [
    "Initial eight endpoint tests completed with two exception-type assertion failures; synchronization and allowed deadline/cancellation outcomes were corrected without retrying a failed observation as success.",
    "The first deadline red-test compile lacked the new diagnostic accessor; a compatible pre-correction variant then demonstrably issued one source I/O after its original budget expired. Final corrected execution issues none.",
    "An incremental build reused the deadline red-test bytecode after source timestamp restoration. javap established that mismatch; this run is disqualified. Final artifact qualification uses a fresh isolated directory.",
    "After the first fresh 75-test build, review identified missing propagation of authenticated higher source rejections. A new regression fails against that endpoint; the corrected final 76-test build validates higher fencing and foreign-reply refusal.",
    "The private incoming endpoint owns one current-view control worker and expiry. Outgoing campaigns are still driven explicitly; no automatic election, READY, historical witness discovery or full distributed S/N acceptance is claimed.",
    "Historical provenance/ancestry delivery, newer-prefix discovery/adoption, fair failed-source rotation, scratch crash recovery, learner/joint transitions and generalized voting/publication remain open."
  ],
